  "title": "Irene's Barbeque Sauce",
  "description": "My mother-in-law gave me this recipe over twenty four years ago. I use it frequently and someone always asks for it. A mixture of tangy ingredients, onion and brown sugar creates one tasty sauce! This will keep in the fridge for several weeks.",
  "authors": [
    "Beverly Hutchinson"
  ],
